OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric bandstand restored two
OL,4,Ayears after devastating fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 112-year-old bandstand that was
OL,7,Falmost destroyed by a fire two years
OL,8,Fago has been unveiled after being
OL,9,F"meticulously" restored.
OL,11,FThe category B-listed Overtoun
OL,12,Fbandstand in Rutherglen was badly
OL,13,Fdamaged in a blaze in June 2024.
OL,15,FThe timber in the historic structure
OL,16,Fwas completely destroyed but enough of
OL,17,Fthe iron frame remained for an accurate
OL,18,Frestoration project.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
