OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric bandstand restored two
OL,4,Ayears after devastating fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraftsmen pieced together its original
OL,7,Fdesign from surviving ironwork, old
OL,8,Fphotographs and rare foundry
OL,9,Fcatalogues, described the process as a
OL,10,F"historical jigsaw puzzle".
